---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import dataset from '../../data/vulnerabilities.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return (dataset.items || []).map(item=>({params:{id:item.id},props:{item}}));}
const {item}=Astro.props;
const percent = (v:number|null)=>v===null||v===undefined?'Unknown':(v*100).toFixed(2)+'%';
---
<Layout title={`${item.id} | CyberIntel`} description={`Defensive context, NVD and EPSS evidence for ${item.id}`}><div class="shell"><section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:20px"><a href="/vulnerabilities/" class="eyebrow">← VULNERABILITY INTELLIGENCE</a><h1>{item.id}</h1><p>{item.title}</p><p class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{item.vendor} · {item.product} · Added to KEV: {item.date_added || 'Unknown'} · Snapshot: {dataset.updated_at}</p></section><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><span class="eyebrow">CVSS base severity</span><strong>{item.cvss ?? 'Unknown'}</strong><small>{item.cvss_severity || 'Not supplied'} · {item.cvss_version || 'Unknown metric'}</small></div><div class="stat"><span class="eyebrow">EPSS probability</span><strong>{percent(item.epss)}</strong><small>Percentile: {percent(item.epss_percentile)} · {item.epss_date || 'Unknown date'}</small></div><div class="stat"><span class="eyebrow">CISA KEV</span><strong class="compact">Known exploited</strong><small>KEV is a global exploitation signal, not an asset scan</small></div></div><section class="section"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Technical context</h2></div><div style="padding:24px"><p class="muted">{item.description || 'No detailed public description found.'}</p><h3>Action and remediation</h3><p>{item.guidance}</p><p class="muted">Check vendor advisories and affected-version data before remediation. Validate affected software, identify internet reachability and business criticality in your authorised environment, and confirm mitigating controls. No AI-generated fix is asserted as vendor guidance.</p><h3>Evidence links</h3><div class="actions"><a class="btn outline" href={item.source_nvd} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NVD record ↗</a><a class="btn outline" href={item.source_cisa} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CISA KEV ↗</a><a class="btn outline" href={item.source_epss} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EPSS documentation ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="card"><h3>Exposure and confidence limitations</h3><p>Shodan identifies observable services but does not independently prove exploitation or confirm every affected software version. CyberIntel does not join this CVE to arbitrary public host IPs. No Tenable VPR or Qualys TruRisk score is calculated or implied.</p></div></section></div></Layout>
